        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-compass section-icon"></i> Unit Overview</h2>
        <p>of Computer Science Unit Foundation Concepts The core concept is the shift from Deterministic Programming (explicit instructions) to Probabilistic Learning (learning from data). Key themes include the Taxonomy of Learning (Supervised, Unsupervised, Reinforcement, Transfer, and Deep Learning) and the Ethical Infrastructure required to manage autonomous decision-making.</p>
    </section>

