        <div class="learning-points">
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Knowledge & Machines:</strong> Can a machine ever "know" something? Does knowledge reside outside human cognition?</li>
                <li><strong>Belief and Evidence:</strong> How does the rise of Generative AI and Deepfakes challenge the "seeing is believing" justification for knowledge?</li>
